    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R002",
      "order": 2,
      "text": "If an invoice-level *charge* appears on a customer invoice but cannot be expressed using existing FOCUS columns, data generators MUST include provider-defined columns (e.g., x_ChargeSubType) to capture the non-FOCUS-defined details needed to support invoice *charges* reconciliation using the *FOCUS dataset*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
